{"ref":"BDB, מְשֻׁלָּם²","hw":"מְשֻׁלָּם²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְשֻׁלָּם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Μεσουλαμ, Μοσολλαμ, etc.:<br><strong>1.</strong>  grandfather of Shaphan <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.3\">2 K 22:3</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of Zerub. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.19\">1 Ch 3:19</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  in Benj.: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.17\">8:17</a>, perhaps = <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.7\">9:7</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.8\">8</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.7\">Ne 11:7</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  in Gad <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.13\">1 Ch 5:13</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  wall-builders: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.4\">Ne 3:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:30\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.30\">30</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.6\">3:6</a>.<br><strong>6.</strong>  a chief <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:21\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.21\">10:21</a>.<br><strong>7.</strong>  priests (distinctions in part obscure): <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.11\">1 Ch 9:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.11\">Ne 11:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.13\">12:13</a> (perhaps = <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁלּוּם</span> <strong>11</strong>). <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.12\">1 Ch 9:12</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.8\">Ne 10:8</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.6\">Ne 12:6</a>. <strong>e.</strong>  v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:33\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.33\">33</a>.<br><strong>8.</strong>  Levites: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.12\">2 Ch 34:12</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:16\" href=\"/Ezra.8.16\">Ezr 8:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:15\" href=\"/Ezra.10.15\">10:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:14\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.14\">Ne 8:14</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.25\">12:25</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁלּוּם</span> <strong>12 a</strong>).<br><strong>9.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:29\" href=\"/Ezra.10.29\">Ezr 10:29</a>.","next":"BDB, מְשִׁלֵּמוֹת","prev":"BDB, שַׁלּוּן"}